                <note rend="inline" type="source">367.1164 Brusa School Trial/16: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-02-14T20:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 14,
                                1928—8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received February 14—5:45
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>19. Department’s 13, February 9, 6 p.m. Four pupil witnesses heard today.
                    Hearings postponed until March 5. Goodsell optimistic.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
